# NOTE on your own course material:
# The sample course in course/ ships with this repo so it runs out of the box.
# Keep your REAL notes and past papers outside this folder and point the
# server at them instead:
#     export COURSE_DIR=/path/to/your/course
# That way your material never passes through git at all.
